    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d953-a3">

                <pb facs="1101" n="1005" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1005"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Lord Salisbury to Mr. White.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-09-24"><hi rendition="#italic">September 24,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In compliance with the request contained in
                    your note of the 22d instant, on the understanding mentioned therein, I have the
                    honor to inform you that permission will be granted for the U. S. gunboat <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Helena</hi> to coal at Bermuda and Gibraltar.</p>
                <p>The secretary of state for the colonies has been requested to issue instructions
                    to the governors of the two colonies to that effect.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">F. H. Villiers</hi></signed>,<lb/>(For
                    the Marquis of Salisbury.)</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
